['02','Wise funded from China bank app','Conditional candidate','Non-mainland individual who works/worked in China; valid tax record showing tax paid within last 3 years; personal accounts, own receiving account. Maximum 300,000 CNY per transfer; overall salary/tax-derived limit also applies.','Remote provider channel to compare with bank quote.','Eligibility excludes many non-salary balances; verification; fees require live quote.','wise'],
['03','Wise funded through Alipay','Conditional candidate','Same Wise outbound eligibility and overall limit; maximum 50,000 CNY per transfer.','Alternative funding interface for the same regulated service.','Not a new allowance; smaller single-transfer limit; cannot reuse salary capacity across services.','wise'],
['04','Other lawful current-account income → bank','Conditional candidate','HSBC asks for source-of-income documents and supporting tax payment certificates for other lawful current-account income.','Route beyond employment wages if source fits.','Classification and evidence required; cannot assume unexplained savings qualify.','pbc hsbc'],
['05','Pension, severance, retirement or compensation → bank','Conditional candidate','HSBC guide asks for supporting documents from disbursing organization to purchase foreign currency with these payments.','Expressly documented income categories.','US pension/trust treatment can be separate and complex; user source unknown.','hsbc world'],
['06','Property-sale net proceeds → bank','Conditional capital route','HSBC requires ID, transfer contract, ownership registration and tax documentation; ownership transfer must be registered. Remittance cannot exceed net proceeds after taxes/fees or owned share.','Explicit proceeds-based route.','Underlying sale taxes/fees remain; pre-immigration or inherited property can require a different route.','hsbc'],
['07','Refund from unsuccessful property purchase','Conditional capital route','HSBC lists ID, original FX settlement receipt, contract termination evidence and housing-authority cancellation proof.','Specific recovery route for a failed purchase.','Only relevant to a genuine refund with original evidence, not general account cash.','hsbc'],
['08','Immigration-related property transfer','SAFE approval route','HSBC requires ID and approval from SAFE office of former domicile.','A formal property-transfer category exists.','Eligibility and approval cannot be presumed from US citizenship alone.','hsbc'],
