costs=[['Original Chinese income or asset-sale tax','Depends on original income/asset classification; tax evidence appears in bank requirements. Not established as a flat FX-conversion tax.','','hsbc'],['US income tax / possible currency gain','Worldwide income rules and section 988 are distinct from the wire itself. No personal basis, income year or rate supplied.','','world 988'],['Foreign tax credit','Potential relief for qualifying foreign income taxes; limitations and exclusion interactions apply. Not an automatic refund of every Chinese tax.','','credit'],['Exchange rate / spread','Use an executable provider quote. No current rate or mid-market spread verified.','','wise fx'],['Provider and sending-bank charges','Wise directs users to the transaction quote for fees; no account-specific bank tariff confirmed.','','wise hsbc'],['Intermediary and receiving charges','No receiving bank or correspondent chain supplied; deduction amounts unverified.','','hsbc'],['Tax-filing / professional costs','No engagement quote supplied; not a government conversion tax.','','credit'],['Reporting penalties','These are compliance risks, not ordinary exchange fees. IRS warns FBAR civil amounts change annually; no current dollar penalty assumed here.','','forms']]
