flags=[['F01 · Account facts','Balance, account title, bank, source and dates, prior nationality/account classification, tax residence, US state, marital/filing status, prior returns and tax certificates are not supplied.','User-specific values left blank; no individualized cheapest-route finding.','pbc hsbc world'],['F02 · Quota wording','PBOC Article 9 refers to domestic-individual purchases; HSBC guide uses broader non-mainland facilitation-quota wording.','Needs review; use documented-source pathway and obtain bank classification, not a blanket USD 50,000 assumption.','pbc hsbc'],['F03 · Tax-filing page','Official Shenzhen URL returned a fetch error twice; only official-domain search excerpt was available.','Partial evidence only; not marked fully verified.','filing'],['F04 · Quotes and delivery time','No executable quote, correspondent fee, receiving tariff or guaranteed delivery time verified for this account.','Numeric values intentionally blank.','wise hsbc'],['F05 · Crypto, stablecoins and informal swaps','No current complete official legal basis and eligible end-to-end conversion route verified in this review.','Not recommended; no evasion instructions. General anti-splitting/fabricated-document rule verified, but not a substitute for current crypto-law research.','pbc'],['F06 · Other apps / cards / ATM / gold','No official end-to-end route for this particular balance verified for other remitters, card cashouts, overseas ATM withdrawals, gold purchase/resale or merchandise schemes.','Excluded from recommended routes; cash/customs and FX duties cannot be assumed away.','customs pbc'],['F07 · Freshness and scope','PBOC text is foundational 2007 regulation; GPO section 988 is 2024 edition; source retrieval does not prove all later amendments absent. HSBC is bank-specific.','Review with executing bank/adviser before acting. All sources accessed 2026-11-07.','pbc 988 hsbc'],['F08 · Cash','Full China cash-permit and US entry rules not verified; declaration is not unlimited export permission.','No large cash-carry recommendation; exact permitted personal cash amount left blank.','customs'],['F09 · Personal-transaction exclusion','Archived section 988(e) must be applied to the actual personal/business/investment facts; no account-level exclusion determined.','No assumed tax exemption and no personal gain calculation.','988'],['F10 · Repository audit','Initial checkout had only an 8-byte README and no pre-existing research, data or application to verify.','Audit covers newly added records and rendered rows; does not certify external websites or future policy changes.','pbc']]
